|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Basic screen definitions (e.g., title)
!|!
!|10000$-=TITLE=RIPscrip Demonstrations$
!|!
!|!
!|-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! What RIP file do we call from our demo screens to return here?
!|!
!|10000$-=RETURN=>TELDEMOS.RET$
!|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Labels for each of the six buttons
!|!
!|10000$-=LAB1=Commands$
!|10000$-=LAB2=Drawings$
!|10000$-=LAB3=Engineering$
!|10000$-=LAB4=Newsletter$
!|10000$-=LAB5=Newspaper$
!|10000$-=LAB6=Online$
!|!              
!|! 
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Text variables to execute when one of the six buttons are clicked
!|!
!|10000$-=CMD1=>TELCMDS.FN$
!|10000$-=CMD2=>TELDRAW.FN$
!|10000$-=CMD3=>TELENGIN.FN$
!|10000$-=CMD4=>DRAGON.RIP$
!|10000$-=CMD5=>NEWSPAPR.RIP$
!|10000$-=CMD6=>ONLINE.RIP$
!|!              
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Where should we go when we click on the "back" button?
!|! 
!|10000$-=BACK=>MENU.RET$
!|!
!|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Define the status messages displayed when the user hovers over one of
!|! the mouse fields on the screen
!|!
!|10000$=-MSG1=Examples of many RIPscrip graphics commands$
!|10000$=-MSG2=Some simple drawings in RIPscrip$
!|10000$=-MSG3=Examples of some engineering applications$
!|10000$=-MSG4=A creative newsletter demonstration$
!|10000$=-MSG5=Display an example of an online newspaper$
!|10000$=-MSG6=How to get a real-life online demonstration$
!|!             
!|10000$=-MSG7=Return to the main menu$
!|!
